5
00:00:39,819 --> 00:00:43,819
You: Give it me on the right side and go back home after that.

6
00:00:41,224 --> 00:00:45,224
Morty (status): Going to drop right.

7
00:00:47,336 --> 00:00:51,336
Morty (status): Opening the gripper.

8
00:00:49,918 --> 00:00:53,918
You: and the gripper and go back home.

9
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:55,120
Morty: I've already sent that command — dropping on the right, opening the gripper, and heading home.

10
00:00:56,900 --> 00:01:00,900
Morty (status): Done — I'm back at the home position. What's next?

